00:44:52.825 --> 00:44:55.412
Hello, Jack.


00:44:55.577 --> 00:44:58.164
Oh, be off with you, Nevermore,
you wicked old bird.


00:44:58.331 --> 00:45:00.333
Go on.


00:45:11.719 --> 00:45:14.179
S-s-say I'm weary,


00:45:14.346 --> 00:45:15.848
say I'm sad;


00:45:16.014 --> 00:45:18.434
Say health and wealth
have missed me;


00:45:18.600 --> 00:45:20.894
Say I'm growing old, but add...


00:45:21.061 --> 00:45:24.356
Lolly kissed me.


00:45:24.523 --> 00:45:27.401
Can you keep a secret?


00:45:32.280 --> 00:45:33.823
There's somebody I want to see,


00:45:33.990 --> 00:45:36.035
but I don't want them to see me.
Does that make sense?


00:45:36.201 --> 00:45:38.036
You're in love
with a wonderful guy?


00:45:38.202 --> 00:45:42.665
- No, I'm not.
- Yes, you are.


00:45:42.832 --> 00:45:44.375
Yes, you are.
Yes, you are.


00:45:54.552 --> 00:45:57.596
The day after tomorrow,
we will crown the May Queen.


00:45:57.763 --> 00:46:01.267
Can anyone think of a more
perfect queen than Beth?


00:46:03.185 --> 00:46:04.603
Do you accept this?


00:46:04.770 --> 00:46:06.605
I'm deeply honored.


00:46:06.773 --> 00:46:09.066
Sure, I accept.


00:46:15.781 --> 00:46:17.783
Lachlan's told us
how the next two days


00:46:17.949 --> 00:46:21.161
are like very special
holidays for y'all.


00:46:21.328 --> 00:46:23.997
After they're over,
Steve and I hope


00:46:24.164 --> 00:46:26.291
you'll come talk to us
about Jesus.


00:46:26.458 --> 00:46:30.711
Like, we'll be waiting
and hoping...


00:46:30.878 --> 00:46:33.798
And praying that y'all come.


